1. [...] tud-da-zu e₂-kur-ta {d}en-lil₂-le bi₂#-in-dug₄-ga#
#lem: X; utud[give birth (to)]; Ekur[1]TN; Enlil[1]DN; dug[speak]
#tr.en: ……, @wDN{Enlil} decreed your birth in the @wTN{E-kur}! 
#etcsl: line-id=1

2. {[d]}nuska tud-da-zu <e₂-kur-ta {d}en-lil₂-le bi₂-in-dug₄-ga>
#lem: Nuska[1]DN; utud[give birth (to)]; Ekur[1]TN; Enlil[1]DN; dug[speak]
#tr.en: @wDN{Nuska}, @wDN{Enlil} decreed your birth in the @wTN{E-kur}! Lord @wDN{Nudimmud}, 
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. en# {d}nu-dim₂-mud-e abzu-ta lugal nam-he₂ mi₂ mu-ri₂-in-dug₄
#lem: en[lord]; Nudimmud[1]DN; abzu[(cosmic) underground water]; lugal[king]; namhe[abundance]; mi[cvne]; dug[speak]
#tr.en: the king of prosperity, honoured you in the @fsux{abzu}. 
#etcsl: line-id=3

4. sukkal zid me-teš₂-e ga-i
#lem: sukkal[secretary]; zid[right]; meteš[praise]; e[bring out]
#tr.en: Good minister, I shall praise you! @wDN{Nuska}, majestic minister of @wDN{Enlil}, 
#etcsl: line-id=4

5. {d}nuska sukkal-mah {d}en-lil₂-la₂ za₃-mi₂-zu dug₃-ga-am₃ ku₇-ku₇-da
#lem: Nuska[1]DN; sukkalmah[an official]; Enlil[1]DN; zamin[praise]; dug[good]; kud[sweet]
#tr.en: your praise is good and most sweet. My king, 
#etcsl: line-id=5

6. lugal-ŋu₁₀ šir₃-re-eš₂ ga-am₃-dug₄
#lem: lugal[king]; šir[song]; dug[speak]
#tr.en: I shall praise you in song! 
#etcsl: line-id=6

7. su₃-ra₂-aŋ₂ sipad# zid {d}en-lil₂-la₂-me-en
#lem: sudaŋ[precious metal or material (possibly amber)]; sipad[shepherd]; zid[right]; Enlil[1]DN
#tr.en: You are the light of the good shepherd @wDN{Enlil}, 
#etcsl: line-id=7

8. mu mah pad₃-da {d}nin-lil₂-la₂-me-en
#lem: mu[name]; mah[great]; pad[find]; Ninlil[1]DN
#tr.en: and you have been given a majestic name by @wDN{Ninlil}. 
#etcsl: line-id=8

9. ŋeštug₂ šum₂-ma {d}en-ki-ka₃-me-en
#lem: ŋeštug[ear]; šum[give]; Enkik[1]DN
#tr.en: You have been given wisdom by @wDN{Enki}. 
#etcsl: line-id=9

10. {d}en-ul {d}nin-ul-e tud-da-me-en
#lem: Enul[1]DN; Ninul[1]DN; utud[give birth (to)]
#tr.en: You were born to @wDN{Enul} and @wDN{Ninul}, 
#etcsl: line-id=10

11. numun nam-en-na-da tab-ba-me-en
#lem: numun[seed]; namen[the office of en-priest]; tab[double]
#tr.en: and so you are united with the lordly seed. 
#etcsl: line-id=11

12. e₂-kur-ra šir₃{{%akk na-a-di ši-ra-X}}-bi-me-en
#lem: Ekur[1]TN; šir[song]; L; L
#tr.en: You are the @wTN{E-kur's} song. 
#etcsl: line-id=12

13. sukkal lugal-a-ni-ir tum₂-ma-me-en
#lem: sukkal[secretary]; lugal[king]; tum[suitable]
#tr.en: You are a minister fit for his king: 
#etcsl: line-id=13

14. {d}nuska {d}en-lil₂-la₂ lu₂ šag₄-ga-na-me-en
#lem: Nuska[1]DN; Enlil[1]DN; lu[person]; šag[heart]
#tr.en: @wDN{Nuska}, you are the man of @wDN{Enlil's} heart. 
#etcsl: line-id=14

15. igi-ŋal₂ {d}a-nun-<na>-ke₄-ne-me-en
#lem: igiŋal[wise]; Anunak[1]DN
#tr.en: You are the wise one among the @wDN{Anuna} gods! 
#etcsl: line-id=15

16. dug₄-ga zid saŋ-bi-še₃ e₃-a-me-en
#lem: dug[speak]; zid[right]; saŋ[head]; e[leave]
#tr.en: You are pre-eminent in just speech! 
#etcsl: line-id=16

17. sukkal zid a-a {d}en-lil₂-ka-me-en
#lem: sukkal[secretary]; zid[right]; aya[father]; Enlil[1]DN
#tr.en: You are the good minister of Father @wDN{Enlil}! 
#etcsl: line-id=17

18. zid dug₄-ga šu nu-bal-e-me-en
#lem: zid[right]; dug[speak]; šu[hand]; bala[turn]
#tr.en: You do not alter what you have spoken justly. 
#etcsl: line-id=18

19. [...] X zalag-ga su₃-ra₂-aŋ₂-bi-me-en
#lem: X; X; zalag[bright]; sudaŋ[precious metal or material (possibly amber)]
#tr.en: You are the light of the shining ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=19

20. [...] nam-nir-ŋal₂ šum₂-ma-me-en
#lem: X; namnirŋal[authority]; šum[give]
#tr.en: You have been given authority ……. 
